BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Asheville Introverts
UID:event_316145830@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260905T041401Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260906T153000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260906T173000
SUMMARY:Fantasy and Sci-Fi Silent Book Club
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Introverts\nBOYB - Bring Your Own Book and rant or r
 ave about your current Fantasy or Sci-fi titles!\n\n**What is a Silent Boo
 k Club?**\nReferred to as "Introvert's Happy Hour"\, Silent Book clubs all
 ow readers to engage with each other without the commitment of reading a s
 hared title. Community members gather in the same place\, have some casual
  chit chat\, and then read silently together. **This group will focus on F
 antasy and Sci-Fi titles (subgenres & related genres are welcome!)**\n\n**
 How does it work?**\nFor the first 15-30 mins we will gather\, grab drinks
  and engage in introductions. Feel free to discuss your recent favorites\,
  mention a title that lives in your head rent free\, or ask for recommenda
 tions! The best part of the Silent Book Club is being able to talk shop wi
 th other readers!\n\nOnce settled in we will dedicate 45 minutes to silent
  reading. Your book can be traditional\, ebook\, or audiobook. Read at you
 r own pace!\n\nAfterwards we will go around show-and-tell style and share 
 what we read with the group. We want to know what you're reading! Organic 
 dialogue welcome!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-introverts/events/316145830
 /
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260816T210725Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260816T210725Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
