BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Asheville Introverts
UID:event_316080357@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260905T041401Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260910T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260910T213000
SUMMARY:Trivia Night @ HIllman Beer
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Introverts\n**Trivia Night at Hillman!**\nNo need to
  be a trivia pro\, we’re just here to have fun! Trivia officially starts
  at 7:00 but I'll be getting there at 6:30 to get a table/dinner.\nThe win
 ning team gets a **$50 gift card**\, which we’ll share with whomever sho
 ws up the following week.\nHope to see you there!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-introverts/events/316080357
 /
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260812T015214Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260812T015214Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Asheville Introverts
UID:event_316162375@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260905T041401Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260913T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260913T190000
SUMMARY:Pizza and Puzzles
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Introverts\nCome hang out\, eat pizza\, and contribu
 te to a jigsaw puzzle.\nPeri has a pizza truck\, coffee bar\, beer\, wine\
 , and cocktails/mocktails.\nI have 500 piece and 350 piece puzzles this ti
 me so you can pick your team based on difficulty level.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-introverts/events/316162375
 /
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260818T005217Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260818T005217Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Asheville Introverts
UID:event_314228736@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260905T041401Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260918T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260918T230000
SUMMARY:Romeo & Juliet by Montford Players
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Introverts\nTwo young lovers from feuding families f
 all head over heels\, hoping their secret romance will bring peace to Vero
 na. But family pride and fate have other plans. With duels\, disguises\, a
 nd heartfelt passion\, Shakespeare’s unforgettable love story blends com
 edy\, tragedy\, and the thrill of first love. It’s timeless\, emotional\
 , and proof that even in heartbreak\, love remains the greatest adventure 
 of all.\n\nThe show begins at 7:30pm.\nStepped ground seating is free\, re
 member to bring blankets\, pillows\, campchairs\, etc to be more comfortab
 le. If you’d like to make an online donation before the show you can do 
 so here: [https://www.montfordparkplayers.org/](https://www.montfordparkpl
 ayers.org/get-tickets-2/)\n\nThe actors will come around at intermission f
 or cash or venmo donations and they typically have a food and drink vendor
  of some kind.\n\nAsheville’s Montford Park Players is North Carolina’
 s longest running Shakespeare theatre company dedicated to providing excep
 tional dramatic entertainment for the enrichment\, education\, and enjoyme
 nt of their audiences\, free of charge.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-introverts/events/314228736
 /
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260411T121339Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260411T121339Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Asheville Introverts
UID:event_316288260@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260905T041401Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260919T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260919T140000
SUMMARY:Visit the Folk Art Center
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Introverts\nCome check out the Folk Art Center\, the
  craft store and exhibition space of the Southern Highland Craft Guild! Th
 e first floor of the center contains the Allanstand Craft Shop\, nationall
 y recognized as the oldest craft shop in America. Upstairs contains multip
 le galleries showcasing traditional and contemporary works by members of t
 he Guild and affiliated organizations. We will be attending during Heritag
 e Weekend\, when several artisans will be on-site demonstrating their craf
 ts. Hope to see you there!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-introverts/events/316288260
 /
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260826T222653Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260826T222653Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
